@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M02 — Proposed account access eligibility
state "Invitation pending" as Pending
state "Active account context" as Active
state "Suspended account context" as Suspended
state "Deletion pending" as Deletion
[*] --> Pending : scoped initial context
Pending --> Active : SM-T008 activation confirmed\n[verified / activated]
Active --> Suspended : SM-T009 suspension confirmed\n[authorized / confirmed]
Suspended --> Active : SM-T010 reinstatement confirmed\n[explicit reinstatement]
Active --> Deletion : SM-T011 deletion request accepted\n[authorized / confirmed]
Suspended --> Deletion : SM-T012 deletion request accepted\n[reviewed closure policy]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
